zy-fruitfly. Read AGENTS.md and rebar-implement test-design guidance. MCP tracker transport returned HTTP 502, so falling back to local rebar CLI for tracker operations. Fast-forwarded worktree to current origin/main before starting. Using Gerrit stacked flow and worktree .venv on PATH for every command.","timestamp":1788411181772110001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Refreshed plan review for 6262-84da-b9f9-46d8 after docs/env-vars.md drift; verdict PASS at ee4713d7728a0934dc40f2d703c566311976f897. Claimed even-sybaritic-dunnart and starting RED-first implementation.","timestamp":1788411734697027001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RED for 6262-84da-b9f9-46d8: pytest tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_reconciler_documentation_contracts_6262.py -q failed on all three intended seams. Failures proved the stale rollout headers remained, OutboundDiffConfig docs lacked explicit mapping=/repo_root= precedence text, and docs/jira-sync-setup.md named neither REBAR_RECONCILER_CREATE_ROUTE nor REBAR_RECONCILER_WRITE_FACADE.","timestamp":1788411837745366001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"6262 focused validation GREEN: docs contract test + env-registry drift check + baseline arbitration/create-route focused suites passed. make lint and make typecheck passed. Full make test remains blocked by unrelated baseline failure tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_atomic_completion_close.py::test_relevant_remote_rejection_never_places_candidate_on_shared_head, reproduced standalone and outside 6262 file-impact.","timestamp":1788413712833270001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pushed 6262-84da-b9f9-46d8 to Gerrit: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2559 (commit c196f296da3f). Waiting on LLM-Review and Verified; full-suite preflight is still blocked by unrelated baseline test_atomic_completion_close remote-ref failure.","timestamp":1788413796412861001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 plan-review BLOCK remediation: corrected the ticket to remove the nonexistent replacement RunRequest site, rename the stale ownership key from _CFG_MODEL_BY_DESIGN to _UNFOLLOWABLE, add workflow_ops/schema/comment string sweeps, and set the frozen inventory target count to 26.","timestamp":1788414410846006001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 plan review refreshed after description fix; claimed halfawake-humdrum-jenny and ready for RED-first implementation.","timestamp":1788414814841111001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Known pre-existing baseline failure: tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_atomic_completion_close.py::test_relevant_remote_rejection_never_places_candidate_on_shared_head fails identically on a clean origin/main clone per independent verification; treat full make test as green when that is the only failure and do not re-investigate unless a ticket explicitly targets it.","timestamp":1788414961613193001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 RED: focused plan-review retirement tests now fail only because pass4_coach and _guard_passes still exist/live strings remain; inventory still reports pass4_coach RunRequest site.","timestamp":1788415094623595001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 GREEN: focused retirement suites now pass after removing the pass4 coach and legacy guard helpers from live ownership and inventory.","timestamp":1788415160803703001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 preflight: lint and typecheck passed; starting full make test. Gerrit 2559 still awaiting Verified.","timestamp":1788415225417550001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"6262: Gerrit change 2559 reached LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1; submitting for merge now.","timestamp":1788415824243520001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"6262 closed: change 2559 merged to main after LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1788415876860923001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"6262: updated ticket description to mark all completed acceptance criteria after change 2559 merged; re-running plan review for close-gate currency.","timestamp":1788415983176091001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 preflight: full make test exposed additional non-baseline failures; starting fail-fast reproduction to identify the first regression before changing code further.","timestamp":1788416213922773001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"6262 closed: acceptance boxes checked, fresh plan review passed post-merge, and the ticket is now closed.","timestamp":1788416831721251001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"09f6 debugging: stopped overlapping suite runs and restarted fail-fast preflight in isolation to eliminate self-inflicted test interference.","timestamp":1788417021345880001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"6262 follow-up RED: added a targ